# Copy this file to `.env` and put a real key on the line below.
#
# `.env` itself is deliberately not tracked. It was until 1 September 2026,
# which meant a real key would have gone into the next commit and from there to
# a public repository — and FoodData Central deactivates any key it finds in
# one. The value that was tracked has never worked, so nothing that ever built
# from this repository lost anything by the change.
#
# A key is free from https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup/ and takes about
# two minutes. Without one the Food tab says it has not been set up; the
# Products tab is unaffected and needs no key at all.

# API KEYS
FDC_API_KEY=
